              "kind": "url",
              "url": "https://sqlite.org/whentouse.html#situations_where_a_client_server_rdbms_may_work_better",
              "quote": "SQLite supports an unlimited number of simultaneous readers, but it will only allow one writer at any instant in time."
            },
            {
              "kind": "url",
              "url": "https://sqlite.org/whentouse.html#situations_where_sqlite_works_well",
